{"check_id":"IAC-DOCKER-ROOT_USER-01","module":"iac","title":"Dockerfile builds an image with no non-root USER instruction","severity":"high","base_severity":"high","confidence":"medium","cwe":"CWE-250","owasp":"A02:2025","cvss":{"vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":5.4},"location":{"path":"terraform/aws/resources/Dockerfile","match_digest":"9eae8b6800754c4b","occurrence":"0","line":1},"logical":{"kind":"file","fqn":"terraform/aws/resources/Dockerfile:1"},"evidence":"FROM python:3.7-slim","remediation":"Create an unprivileged account (`RUN addgroup -S app && adduser -S app -G app` or\nequivalent for the base distro) and add a `USER app` instruction before the container's default\nentrypoint/cmd runs, so the process does not run as root by default. An attacker who achieves code\nexecution inside the container then does not automatically inherit root privileges in the\ncontainer's own namespace.","references":["CWE-250"],"cis":[],"exposure":"unknown","auth":"user","sensitive_data":false,"cell":"terraform/aws","status":"new","first_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","last_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","suppressed":false,"suppressed_by":null,"contributors":[],"derived_into":[],"related":[],"endpoint_hosts":[],"rule_digest":"b3c54975a6da7361141eb29cf13f096d03c05f01bf02e28c960ba8b8ab65194b","fingerprint":"6d937479ae4704b00f5f9f2ced28ce2f3ed52cde39685f107dd384cf2e83b3c2"}
{"check_id":"IAC-DOCKER-UNPINNED_DIGEST-01","module":"iac","title":"Base image not pinned to a content digest","severity":"low","base_severity":"low","confidence":"medium","cwe":"CWE-829","owasp":"A08:2025","cvss":{"vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":5.4},"location":{"path":"terraform/aws/resources/Dockerfile","match_digest":"9eae8b6800754c4b","occurrence":"0","line":1},"logical":{"kind":"file","fqn":"terraform/aws/resources/Dockerfile:1"},"evidence":"FROM python:3.7-slim","remediation":"Pin the base image with an `@sha256:<digest>` suffix (`docker pull` and then\n`docker inspect --format '{{index .RepoDigests 0}}'` the image you intend to use, or read the\ndigest off the registry) in addition to, or instead of, a tag - a tag can be repointed at a\ndifferent image server-side, but a digest cannot.","references":["CWE-829"],"cis":[],"exposure":"unknown","auth":"user","sensitive_data":false,"cell":"terraform/aws","status":"new","first_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","last_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","suppressed":false,"suppressed_by":null,"contributors":[],"derived_into":[],"related":[],"endpoint_hosts":[],"rule_digest":"a8a8262d692fd1591352e7229d94b898bb533b1429df51bb0264f9bb1b4cbb30","fingerprint":"925e6eaf0b45704861ef17e0b705fc2ef260c2509691bccfa4d90d3d813566f5"}
{"check_id":"IAC-TF-KEY_ROTATION_DISABLED-01","module":"iac","title":"KMS key created without automatic key rotation enabled","severity":"medium","base_severity":"medium","confidence":"medium","cwe":"CWE-320","owasp":"A04:2025","cvss":{"vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":5.4},"location":{"path":"terraform/aws/kms.tf","match_digest":"6ec4998285c64dd4","occurrence":"0","line":1},"logical":{"kind":"file","fqn":"terraform/aws/kms.tf:1"},"evidence":"resource \"aws_kms_key\" \"logs_key\" {","remediation":"Add enable_key_rotation = true to the aws_kms_key resource so AWS rotates\nthe backing key material annually without any application-visible change (KMS\ntransparently keeps prior key material available for decrypting old ciphertext).","references":["CWE-320","CIS-AWS-3.8"],"cis":["3.8"],"exposure":"unknown","auth":"user","sensitive_data":false,"cell":"terraform/aws","status":"new","first_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","last_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","suppressed":false,"suppressed_by":null,"contributors":[],"derived_into":[],"related":[],"endpoint_hosts":[],"rule_digest":"961357dd04c8871ba95ec0b8384dec2a7ed51d8cf7c3a3127a862936d8f03ba8","fingerprint":"8fb3526c22e9a77c0bd375b9f5b3b0ab2ea8cb2e62c18c90ff6b1d48daa32df8"}
{"check_id":"IAC-TF-OPEN_CIDR-01","module":"iac","title":"Security group rule open to 0.0.0.0/0","severity":"high","base_severity":"high","confidence":"high","cwe":"CWE-284","owasp":"A02:2025","cvss":{"vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":5.4},"location":{"path":"terraform/aws/db-app.tf","match_digest":"ad8d439263d9d26f","occurrence":"0","line":150},"logical":{"kind":"file","fqn":"terraform/aws/db-app.tf:150"},"evidence":"cidr_blocks       = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"","remediation":"Restrict the CIDR to the smallest network that needs access.\nWhere public reachability is genuinely required (a public load balancer listener),\nterminate it at an edge that applies WAF and rate limiting rather than at the\ninstance security group, and record the exception with an inline\n\"# scoursh-allow: open-cidr\" comment on the preceding line.","references":["CIS-AWS-5.2"],"cis":["5.2","5.3"],"exposure":"unknown","auth":"user","sensitive_data":false,"cell":"terraform/aws","status":"new","first_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","last_seen":"2026-09-10T11:10:21Z","suppressed":false,"suppressed_by":null,"contributors":[],"derived_into":[],"related":[],"endpoint_hosts":[],"rule_digest":"f6017a0e7147bcbd3511037b6bdc6c087c011020cec6eacac63730fa79221609","fingerprint":"4c81aa94e82245b1df518552cb11ee9ae860ac75cf038b093a7216234fdf60e2"}
